 lines=['# Preserve global appearance; focus target-context motion','','Exposed HC64 prospective fixed branch. Earlier both-modality fill/restoration cannot isolate loss of actor/interaction appearance from competing motion. New main retains ORIGINAL 2D appearance everywhere; original 3D motion retained inside fixed1.5 fulltime complete-box context, outsidevalid filled with sameframe inside3D mean FP32thenFP16. Global actors/objects can remain in appearance. Original motion has fullclipcontext; no claim of pure local action isolation.','','Original complete caption, all65 physicalnodes, original dense keys/padding/safetycorner, native fusion/two passes/six layers/two-offset hull/physical MBR and final complete-boxDP/eight observations unchanged. EmptyROIframe reverts oldfullvalid, recorded/noqueryskip. Reflected3D samearea, appearanceonly andreflected2D role controls, wrong-time3D. Wrong-time reverses original featureframeorder within each offset beforecurrentROI/fill: clips NOT internally reversed, not a true backwardvideo or knownfalseevent. Primary fixed halfGlobal6+halfMotionTarget; DirectMotion sameinformation. BothFocus EXACT old17FillOnlyposterior/interval/finalbox alias with0newmodelcalls, not renamed newmethod.','','All64 active; all64 predictions seal before independent CPU official labels. Source/Native/self/noop aliases, Full64hidden/logits/q/Sourceboxes bitwise. No new RGB/visualencoder/text/expert/observations/querylearning/optimizer; no context/fusion/modality-blend strengthscan. FourCPUtests modalitypreservation/insidepadding/reflectionfallback/temporalindexroundtrip.','','|Arm|complete vIoU|tIoU|time +/−/=|time harm>5pp|','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
